  "solution": "Given equation: 30 + 28 - 34 ÷ 2 × 4 = 2\n\n1. 28 and 34\n\n30 + 34 - __**28 ÷ 2**__ × 4 = 2\n\n⇒ 30 + 34 - __**14 × 4**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**30 + 34**__ - 56 = 2\n\n⇒ 64 - 56 = 2\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 2 \n\n2. 34 and 4\n\n30 + 28 - 4 ÷ 2 × 34 = 2\n\n⇒ 30 + 28 - __**4 ÷ 2**__ × 34 = 2\n\n⇒ 30 + 28 - __**2 × 34**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**30 + 28**__ - 68 = 2\n\n⇒ 58 - 68 = 2\n\n⇒ -10 ≠ 2\n\n3. 30 and 34\n\n34 + 28 - __**30 ÷ 2**__ × 4 = 2\n\n⇒ 34 + 28 - __**15 × 4**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**34 + 28**__ - 60 = 2\n\n⇒ 62 - 60 = 2\n\n⇒ 2 = 2\n\n4. 4 and 2\n\n30 + 28 - __**34 ÷ 4**__ × 2 = 2\n\n⇒ 30 + 28 - __**8.5 × 2**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**30 + 28**__ - 17 = 2\n\n⇒ 58 - 17 = 2\n\n⇒ 41 ≠ 2\n\nHence, '**30 and 34**' is the correct answer.",
